<title>USA: Cardinal Realty Services Inc Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Cardinal Realty Services Inc Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.13</p>
<p> Net			    887			503</p>
<p> Revs			15,700		   14,900</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   0.69		     0.81</p>
<p> Net			  2,700		    3,100</p>
<p> Revs			45,100		   44,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Funds from operations (FFO) from wholly owned properties for Q3 $1.1 million vs $474,000.</p>
<p>1996 results are compared to pro forma results for the same periods of 1995. The pro forma results assume the reclassification of the company's wholly owned properties from Real Estate Assets held for sale to Operating Real Estate Assets, which occurred effective January 1,1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
